  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DPOD DF (2015) - Disabled People&apos;s Organisations Denmark&apos;s (DPOD) Disability Fund 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Disability Fund supports initiatives led by Danish disability organizations in partnership with organizations in developing countries. These projects aim to strengthen the disability movement and promote lasting, positive change in the living conditions, participation, and inclusion of persons with disabilities&#x2014;locally, nationally, and globally.</narrative>
